backwards(or **bkwds**) *word*: Send word backwards
me: Send bot name and tag
happy: Be happy
sad: pure sadness
echo *word*: echo word
spam *word number*: Send word number times. Number must be 3 digits(If you want one or two digits, use leading zeros)
greet: Greet you
prefix *prefix*: change prefix for your server
invite: Get Invite link for bot and server
scream *word*: Scream word.
countdown(or **ctdwn**) *count*: Send a count second countdown. count must be 3 digits(If you want one or two digits, use leading zeros).
gimme meme: Send a random meme
dm: Get a DM from the bot
my stuff *user*: send info about user
time: Send PST time
brawl stars box sim: Enter a Brawl stars box simulator
suggest: suggest something to add to the bot